Node ID=20 cathedral
Text=You stand within one of the few edifices that has survived the dark times since the Disjunction. The Cathedral of Barcelona has become a symbol of strength and stability for many of us. Within this Cathedral, the Knights Templar guard the True Cross, the most valuable of the holy relics rescued during the crusades.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have other questions before I go.
Go to node ID=5 questions

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I'll be leaving now. Goodbye.
Go to node ID=10 Goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=30 templar
Text=We are a knight order dedicated to protecting Europe against the forces of darkness. We strive to uphold the honorable name of King Richard the Lionhearted and promote virtue and chivalry. We are also charged with the protection of the holy relics.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have other questions before I go.
Go to node ID=5 questions

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I'll be leaving now. Goodbye.
